	(text "IMU (replaces MPU9250 GY-9250 module)\nMPU-9250 = MPU-6500 die + AK8963 magnetometer and is out of stock at JLCPCB, so the two functions are now separate chips:\nU601 MPU-6500 accel/gyro at I2C 0x69 (AD0 = 3V3; 0x68 is the DS3231). Firmware Mpu9250.cpp already accepts WHO_AM_I 0x70.\nU602 LIS3MDL magnetometer at I2C 0x1E (SA1 = 3V3); needs a new small firmware driver (it replaces the AK8963 at 0x0C).\nBoth chips in I2C mode (CS = 3V3). No LDO: both run from the board 3V3. No I2C pull-ups here (one 4.7k pair on esp32-core).\nMPU-6500: VDD 100nF, VDDIO 10nF, REGOUT 100nF; FSYNC and RESV pin 20 to GND; RESV pin 19 and NC pins left open.\nPCB: place both chips with the same orientation; keep the LIS3MDL at least 20 mm from the PSU header,\nthe CR2032 holder and the screw terminals."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c6cc0a65-144a-46f5-b290-da84e5de9d04")
	)
